# incident-severity-lint has NO runtime data files: the CLI imports argparse,
# json, os and sys only, and the single open() call reads the record path the
# user passes on the command line. So there is nothing to ship as package data
# and no [tool.setuptools.package-data] entry. What follows is sdist content -
# the docs and the example that the README refers to - so that a source tarball
# is self-contained.
include README.md
include LICENCE.txt
include SEVERITY-MATRIX.md
include POSTMORTEM-TEMPLATE.md
recursive-include examples *.json
